flowchart LR
    Start([Open PROTECT]) --> App[React app loads]
    App --> Access{Public or staff?}

    Access -->|Public| Public[Public user]
    Public --> Announcements[Announcements]
    Public --> Needs[Community needs form]

    Access -->|Staff| Staff[Barangay staff]
    Staff --> Login[Login / auth check]
    Login --> Dashboard[Dashboard]
    Dashboard --> Module{Choose module}

    Module --> Residents[Resident Profiling]
    Module --> GIS[GIS Household Map]
    Module --> Incident[Crime & Incident]
    Module --> Benefits[Beneficiary Tracking]
    Module --> QR[QR Verification]
    Module --> Analytics[Analytics]
    Module --> Reports[DILG Reports]
    Module --> Ordinance[Ordinance Archive]
    Module --> Audit[System & Audit]

    Staff --> Auth[Supabase Auth]
    Login --> Auth

    Residents --> DB[(PostgreSQL + RLS)]
    GIS --> DB
    Incident --> DB
    Benefits --> DB
    QR --> DB
    Analytics --> DB
    Reports --> DB
    Ordinance --> DB
    Audit --> DB
    Announcements --> DB
    Needs --> DB

    DB --> Storage[(Storage buckets)]
    DB --> AuditLogs[(Audit logs)]
    DB --> Backup[(system-backups bucket)]

    Cron[pg_cron weekly backup] --> Export[backup-export Edge Function]
    Export --> Backup
    Export --> DB

    DB --> Continue{Continue session?}
    Continue -->|Yes| Dashboard
    Continue -->|No| Logout([Logout])

